{
  "about": "シフトの期間 (spec/calendar.md, The shift period). `start` is the day of the month a period starts on: 1 for the month itself, else 2 to 28, running to the day before it a month on; each page of the calendar is one, `[first, last]`. containing: the period holding `day`, as the calendar opens on today's and a day's link on its own. stepped: the period `by` pages on from `page`, or back for a negative count. picked: the period 月を選ぶ's `month` opens, the one starting in it. weeks: the days a page draws, whole weeks from `weekStart` (0 for Sunday) holding the period, as the first and last day drawn and the count of weeks. written: a period by its days (spec/calendar.md, How days are written): `short` alone, `year` where the year shows, its last day's too when it is another year, `full` titling a picture, and `english` for that title with 月と曜日 in English.",
  "containing": [
    {
      "name": "a day of the month, without a period",
      "start": 1,
      "day": "2026-10-23",
      "expected": ["2026-10-01", "2026-10-31"]
    },
    {
      "name": "the day before the start is the period's last",
      "start": 15,
      "day": "2026-10-14",
      "expected": ["2026-09-15", "2026-10-14"]
    },
    {
      "name": "the start day is the period's first",
      "start": 15,
      "day": "2026-10-15",
      "expected": ["2026-10-15", "2026-11-14"]
    },
    {
      "name": "across a year",
      "start": 15,
      "day": "2027-01-03",
      "expected": ["2026-12-15", "2027-01-14"]
    },
    {
      "name": "a period over February",
      "start": 28,
      "day": "2027-02-27",
      "expected": ["2027-01-28", "2027-02-27"]
    }
  ],
  "stepped": [
    {
      "name": "the next month, without a period",
      "start": 1,
      "page": ["2026-10-01", "2026-10-31"],
      "by": 1,
      "expected": ["2026-11-01", "2026-11-30"]
    },
    {
      "name": "the next period",
      "start": 15,
      "page": ["2026-10-15", "2026-11-14"],
      "by": 1,
      "expected": ["2026-11-15", "2026-12-14"]
    },
    {
      "name": "back across a year",
      "start": 15,
      "page": ["2027-01-15", "2027-02-14"],
      "by": -2,
      "expected": ["2026-11-15", "2026-12-14"]
    },
    {
      "name": "over February",
      "start": 28,
      "page": ["2027-01-28", "2027-02-27"],
      "by": 1,
      "expected": ["2027-02-28", "2027-03-27"]
    }
  ],
  "picked": [
    {
      "name": "the month itself, without a period",
      "start": 1,
      "month": "2026-10",
      "expected": ["2026-10-01", "2026-10-31"]
    },
    {
      "name": "the period starting in the month",
      "start": 15,
      "month": "2026-10",
      "expected": ["2026-10-15", "2026-11-14"]
    },
    {
      "name": "a period starting in December runs into the next year",
      "start": 15,
      "month": "2026-12",
      "expected": ["2026-12-15", "2027-01-14"]
    }
  ],
  "weeks": [
